Z||000000||Ozzy||04-01-2001||02:38 PM||||Hi Gang,<P>Aside from my lingering Fiero habit, I'm thinking about resurecting another past hobby and doing a duo with a friend of mine. She is a potential player down the track with a good voice and good stage presence. <P>My background is guitars, mandolin, and mostly backing vocals. Also lots of studio and sound reinforcement background and some limited MIDI. (Always left that to the keyboard player  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )I have been in many bands and duos in years past but never really got into it here with career and all..<P>I want to keep this really simple yet provide as full a sound as possible. I have 2 laptops at my disposal and can rent PA's cheaply. I already have the necessary guitar equipment and my intention to provide only guitar backing. Hopefully with prepackaged midi compositions or similar via my laptop and maybe a sound module if needed.<P>Any thoughts and suggestions from those in the game would be appreciated.<P>Oz||||reg||6
Z||000001||Songman||04-01-2001||02:45 PM||||I am a country music singer by trade. I also write, play guitar, piano, drums, and play around with fiddle, banjo, mandolin and others...<P>Not sure how much of that relates to what you are doing, but nice to meet another musician anyway. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Ozzy||04-01-2001||03:27 PM||||Hey Songman....Ditto's!<P>Not real relevant other than we both play . I'm avoiding the band thing altogether!!! Therefore, needing some simple backing via electronic methods. I'm country at heart along less contemporary lines...Amazing Rythym Aces, David Alen Coe etc, but have played nearlly every genre of music at some point to be able to eat. Music ruled my life at one point. Can't have that now with a really good, demanding career and a great wife and baby boy to boot. Bands are the real thing but such a bloody hassle with egos, personalities and schedules. I'm just looking for a simplified outlet and to help someone get a start in something she want's to do.<P>OZ||||reg||1
