Z||000007||Ozzy||04-01-2001||09:05 PM||||Hey Cliff,<P>DOn't know of any WAV to MP3 personally but someone here must...<P>Have you used any of the MIDI and A2D digital mixing software such as Cakewalk, etc?<P>I tried the demo some time ago but it's too expensive and much too elaborate for my needs here. At that time I went hunting around the internet and found literaly thousands of pre arranged MIDI files of all genres. I don't have, or care to devote, the time it takes to write elctronic compositions of covers anymore. I'm kinda looking for a Freeware or cheap "Band ina Box" type of thing. Musical perfection will give way to simplicity and convenience unlike my past in the music business.<P>Oz||||reg||14
