Z||000010||Ozzy||04-02-2001||07:38 PM||||Right on... Maybe I should re visit the Cakewalk option...My biggest problem is the more controls I have, the more I mess with them! Ever searching for that "perfect" tweak.<P>The advances in DSP effects and digital mixing software have really come around in the last few years. Especially for the PC. Used to be only Mac's had that capability that worked well in the studio. I guess I need to start searching around the net and downloading / installing countless programs to see if any have what I'm looking for.||||reg||12
